docs {
  The flows visible to the account, including the platform's CATALOGUE — which is
  seeded in the migration and inherited by every account that does not declare its
  own.

  An empty `owner_scope` lists every level. Filled in (platform | account |
  workspace | project | demand), it lists only that one.
}
